Z||000005||Black88GT||12-19-2000||09:26 PM||||Yeah, seriously.  Thats commonplace on the net though, and most places for that matter.   Everyone wants to brag about there cars then they get all worked up over competition and stuff.<P>I only flamed Cutter because he was flaming Fiero's on the MR2 board, which is B.S. IMHO especially since he used to be on this board and stuff.  <P>I think PBS has the right idea on the MR2 board (I went over to look), but I would just let it go because really its only between the seller and the buyer.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||1
Z||000006||Predator||12-19-2000||09:42 PM||||Well I read through the thread and I aggree that it really is between the seller and buyer. Personally I love my Fiero. That is my opinion, and nothing else matters. I really like lots of other cars too. I don't have blinders. I can't understand why people pick one car,and all others are trash to them. I like some of the MR2's. I like Camaro, Firebird, Vette's, 3000GT, you name it they are all nice in their own way. I may get flammed out the ying yang for this post, but everybody needs to losen up a bit over who's car is better than the other. I belong to this Forum because I own a Fiero and I like it, and this is a great place to get information on the car. Most of the guys here are pretty cool too. I read some of these flame wars between Fiero's and other cars and have to laugh sometimes. For every car out there, there is another one that is faster or handles better and so forth. Anyway peace guys. ||||reg||1
Z||000007||bHooper||12-19-2000||10:13 PM||||i will keep my comments brief.<P>in october, i paid for and received a pair of door panels... $50+11 s/h<P>they were rough, with torn carpet, and blue paint.<P>i emailed him and he offered to send be parts to make up some of the difference.<P>he told me 4 times that he was goint to, or had, sent he parts over the next 1.5 months.<P>anyway, it just a case of bad misrepresentation...  i could have bought panels from several people, <B>much</B> cheaper and been totally satisfied.<P>hoop||||reg||1
Z||000008||88formula||12-19-2000||10:44 PM||||I agree with Predator. I know my car is not the fastest best handling mid engine car on the road and I don't blanking care. Think about how stupid the concept is! I too like many other vehicles from SUV's and trucks, classic muscle cars, modern European sports sedans, Japanese sports cars, and almost everything else. I am open minded about the subject. I think a true car enthusiast should be!<P>When members on either side start saying things like my car is better than your car and bla bla bla it is fricking stupid and accomplishes nothing. Intelligent people have arguments so that they can come to an agreement and understanding of each others differences. They make relevant points and bring up facts and statistics to help back up their opinions in a respectful manner. In the end both parties learn something from each other and usually come to an agreed upon conclusion (the purpose of an argument). <P>Idiots have quarrels were they just go back and forth (like immature little kids) for ever based on uneducated guesses, opinions and conditions of self worth. They are usually impulsive by talking before they think about what they are saying. They also don’t seem to want to learn but to just have the final word. The final word is my car is better than yours no mine is better no mine is better no mine is better and bla bla blaaaaaaaaa.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000009||Seanh||12-19-2000||10:58 PM||||I just wanted to say somthing. I totally disagree with most of the MR2 guys saying that since the parts are free, he can take how ever long he wants to send them. Thats wrong. If you say your gonna send them, you have a commitment to send them, at a price or not. People who value their business reputation would have glady taken care of the problem with the door panels. CUTTER had a chance to resolve the issue before it ever got this far. He said it himself, the only reason he posted is because he wasnt man enough to take the names he was being called and had to shoot off his foul mouth because he thinks that it is the only way to get your point across. Maybe I just say that because I am a cool-headed person and it takes alot to pi$$ me off. Seeing a fellow Fiero owner being screwed over like that did make me quite angry.||||reg||1
