Z||000011||Tigger||12-19-2000||11:11 PM||||Geeze, now he's finally telling his story about what happened over at the MR2 forum. <P>Why couldn't he had done that right from the beginning here?  Better yet, told the people who had posted here before him to hold their horses, he was going to work things out with hoop.<P>Instead, we get continous blasts of "My car is better than yours."  Then stimpy says something like "Hey look, don't post any more B/S here until you've worked things out with hoop, and if you don't want to work things out with him, just leave the thread alone."  Only then does he resort to childish insults and more hype about his car.<P>How does one expect to gain any respect doing that?<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 12-19-2000).]||||reg||5
