Z||000013||Cheever2||12-19-2000||11:21 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Seanh:<BR><B>I totally disagree with most of the MR2 guys saying that since the parts are free, he can take how ever long he wants to send them. Thats wrong. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE>I go along with that 100%.<BR>-<BR>I somehow missed that whole thing all this time until this thread, and then caught up on all of it.  My opinion on the matter won't change anything.  But now that I know what this Cutter guy is like, and what he has done, if he shows up at any function I'm at, he will discover that I don't welcome his company.  You want to call that a threat?  You want to roast me for it?  So be it.  There has only been one person I have ever met (I'm 43) whose presence I could not tolerate, and this would probably make a second.  Even writing this won't do anything productive, I know, but you don't just act like that and talk like that and expect any acceptance, and I'm voicing my disgust at this repulsive idiot.<BR>   <P>||||reg||6
Z||000014||stimpy||12-19-2000||11:59 PM||||You know, after actually reading turdCUTTER's acount of how the deal went down (and realizing the truth lies somewhere between two sides of a story) I can have some degree of understanding of his situation. If indeed the parts in question were of dubious value, then I think caveat emptor would be the operating latin phrase here. (Thats buyer beware, y'all) Before shuffling out the fitty clams, hoop may have requested pictures showing the condition. I haven't priced door panels, but I wouldn't be surprised if they garnered $25 a pop in so so condition at the wrecking yard. <P>Obviously hoop was not pleased, feeling the product was misrepresented. He attempted to handle it in a private manner, apparently. As last resort, he posted on the forum.  Here is where I kinda cringe. Suddenly people are posting vicious, nasty things about CUTTER. Being the kinda guy that I am that can spot an *******  at 100 yards, and having the uncanny ability to draw undue attention from said assholes, I was rather shocked that I hadn't had run-ins, and I questioned the necessity of these assaults.  <BR>But sure enough, send some guys enough rope to pull themselves out and they will find a way to hang themselves with it. Msr. CUTTER felt it was more appropriate to blather on with MR2 vs Fiero hype. Totally irrelevent. And then post a new thread asking for others to come to his defense. Like he has any allies left!  I tried to cool things down and pleaded with Mr. C to retain some self respect and just shut up and fix things away from the board, and suddenly <B>I</B> am the one who is hit with his unflinching inanities about my alleged sexual orientation. <P>Moral of the story. Calling someone a slobbering pigf*cker, while poetic, does not tend to smooth out the rough spots. I think peer pressure is an effective tool, but when the peerage is throwing 3rd grade schoolyard taunts aroud, response will be in kind. And when someone calls you out in a forum, go the high road and handle your business privately. <P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000015||CUTTER||12-20-2000||12:10 AM||||well, I didnt meen to get people all worked up, it just p'ed me off when people were calling me all those stupid names and they dont even know me! There are a few people on the forum who have met me even though I am the "hippy looking, acting" or the "lurch" kind of person, its how I am and I like who I am! I have changed alot in the past 6 months, personality, looks, I dont know why or how it just happened! I used to smoke alot of pot but I have quit for 3-4 months now and realize its not for me! Everyone who has met me or know me, know for a fack that Im not a mean person, but very nice person. And hoop, I told you i sent the parts because I had them packed and went to the store that ships UPS and they were closed for the day, but didnt say anything to you because i knew you wouldnt believe me, and I was at work when the guy bought my parts car and he took ALL, but the tail-light and drip-strip with him. My parents thought everything went but that but I had a little pile of stuff that didnt go with him, but he took it anyways. I am trying to get ahold of him everyday and get your parts, if you dont beileve me fine! But you will get your parts i promised you sooner or later. I will give you his phone number if you want to call him and tell him those parts were yours and you need them ASAP. He also has my fieroGT rims and tires which he is NOT suposed to have but he need to get the car back to his house and said he will give the rims and tires back to me! I tried to call him everyday but I think he has caller ID and is not answering to my calls. Maybe he will with you! If he doesnt answer his phone I have his address and im going up to his house for a little 1 on 1 if he doesnt cooperate. I know how it feels to be screwed over, I didnt meen to screw any of you over. If you dont believe it fine, just dont post any more flames on this board or the MR2 board. I am planning on alot of meets this year one in OC maryland for a fiero, MR2 mid summer meet. I want who ever to be there. Anyone, hoop, GT bastard, black88GT. Anyone! all of you know that i had a 87GT and I loved that thing no matter how many problems it gave me. It was my 1st car and I beat the hell outa it. Thats why it didnt last. I drive the MR2 hard but dont beat it. I mostly just drive fast, and race here and there. So please lets just drop this, and let it stand how it is. I still want to be a part of the forum, why do you think I keep comming back? I dont want anyone thinking im a bad person, unless you have met me and know for a fact, and nobody but 2-3 forum members have met me. Hypnotize being one of them. I thought he was a veery nice perosn, but if he thinks im a "lurch" kind of person then fine! Just explain to me what the "lurch" kind of person is. I dont talk much around people i dont know because its how i am. Its like.....uh, i dont know how the person is, dont know if what i have to say will offend them, ect. So think what you want and no more flames please!, Sorry for all the trouble. If you dont want me to come back I understand and cliff can delete my name and ban my IP. I really would like to see some of you at OC maryland in the summer. Sorry for the flames, and sorry for dising the fiero even though I had one that was a POS! doesnt meen they all are!<P>Peace.....<P>91 Turbo MR2 - Downpipe, fuel cut defencer, Boost controler, PT Remenufactured turbo stage 2 50 trim, Prestolight wires, Borbet type M wheels, pirelli z-rated tires, Toms scoop, custom dash, custom mounted fire extinquisher on pillar.||||reg||1
